The easiest way to run powerful Slider on your WordPress website or blog.

== Description ==

FruitSlider for WordPress is the easiest way to run Powerfull Fruitslider. 
Create Custom gallery , add Slider for gallery , create design and animation for individual slide. 
Extra feature for slider like a Thumbnail settings, bullet , navigation settings, select colour option for slider for different gallery.

== Installation ==

1. Upload the entire `FruitSlider` folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.

